<title>USA: TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Rhode Island 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$255,000 Hall of Fame Championships grass court tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First Round</p>
<p>1-Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat Vince Spadea (U.S.) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(3-7) 6-3</p>
<p>2-Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat STeve Bryan (U.S.) 4-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 7-5</p>
<p>3-Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Jeff Salzenstein (U.S.)</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
<p>David Wheaton (U.S.) beat 6-Marzio Martelli (Italy) 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Kevin Ullyett (South Africa) beat Murphy Jensen (U.S.) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Luke Jensen (U.S.) beat Michael Shyjan (U.S.) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Bryan Shelton (U.S.) beat Geoff Grant (U.S.) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Michael Joyce (U.S.) beat Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>David Dilucia (U.S.) beat Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>3-6 7-6 (7-3)</p>
</text>
